  (text "Commander numpad module (rev N0) - the 24 keys, 6 columns x 4 rows as on NUMPAD_MODULE of the chassis model\n(key pitch 17.0 mm across, 17.5 / 17.5 / 18.0 mm down; 12 x 12 mm caps).  Each key is a 12 mm four-leg metal snap\ndome on gold pads (the model's caps start right on the board: nothing taller fits; domes last 1-5 million presses).  Every key has its own pin (internal\npull-ups of the microcontroller, key to ground): no matrix, no diodes, no ghosting, any number of keys at once.\nKey SW_r_c = row r (1 = nearest the touchpad module), column c (1 = rear).  The key on P3.2 (SW_1_1) doubles as\nthe boot-loader key: hold it while plugging the cable in." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 25.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left top)) (uuid "1e8836f8-7466-542a-b7d6-d98f14eaa458"))
